# Session Memory: ENSA Clubs Page

## Current State (June 8, 2026)
- **Complete** - Clubs page is fully production-ready
- **Build** - Passes with 172 modules, zero errors
- **Server** - Returns 200 with correct Inertia page and all 6 clubs' data

## Files Created/Modified
### New
- `resources/js/Components/Navbar.jsx` — sticky navbar with bøg branding, nav links, user chip
- `resources/js/Components/ClubCard.jsx` — card with bg image, badge, multi-layer glow hover
- `resources/js/Components/ClubModal.jsx` — 6-tab modal (Discover/Video/Gallery/Join/Reviews/Puzzle)
- `resources/js/Components/JoinForm.jsx` — inscription form (name, email, filière, motivation)
- `resources/js/Components/MediaGallery.jsx` — image/video carousel with thumbnails
- `resources/js/Components/StarRating.jsx` — interactive 5-star rating
- `resources/js/Components/SlidingPuzzle.jsx` — 3×3 tile puzzle
- `resources/js/data/clubs.js` — centralized data for all 6 clubs

### Modified
- `resources/js/Pages/Clubs/Index.jsx` — main page (integrated Navbar, grid, footer)
- `app/Http/Controllers/ClubController.php` — synced data with JS source
- `resources/css/app.css` — added 5 keyframes + thin scrollbar
- `resources/views/app.blade.php` — **fixed**: removed conflicting style.css, pure dark theme
- `bootstrap/app.php` — **fixed**: renamed InertiaMiddleware → Middleware (v3 API)

## Key Fix Applied
**Blade layout conflict**: `public/css/style.css` from the original project had a light theme with glassmorphism. Changed `app.blade.php` to:
- Remove `style.css` loading
- Add `<html class="dark">` for Tailwind dark mode
- Body: `bg-slate-950 text-white`
- Minimal shell — React controls all UI

## Data
6 clubs: EIC, CRER, IADS, CYBER, RST, CIELK
- EIC/CRER have verified real Instagram/LinkedIn handles
- Others point to verified ENSA-related pages
- Media from Unsplash/Coverr

## Routes
- `/clubs` — Inertia page, served by `ClubController@index`

## Dependencies
- inertia-laravel v3.1.0 (server)
- @inertiajs/inertia v0.11.1 + @inertiajs/inertia-react v0.8.1 (client)
- React 19 + Tailwind v4
- Vite 7.3.5
